The Threshold Authority is one of the police organisations that work across [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Its officers wear green uniforms carrying a large "TA", and they are the police who keep the poorer districts, such as [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]].

When the Authority wants to stop someone without announcing itself, it sends unmarked cars with a green light on the roof and a loudspeaker, and plainclothes officers to tail and find an excuse to pull a car over. The Authority keeps no computers; an officer radios a plate back to dispatch and dispatch goes through the paperwork by hand. They track known associates of orgs like the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]], and a car with up-to-date registration is no protection if the plate comes up on a scan.

Some of their officers ride with a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] in the car, which projects itself as a voice over the vehicle's radio and keeps records of where that car has been. One such officer, with a Heart called Warning Bell, once pulled over the party on the highway and asked them to wait while he checked a report. The party fought their way out, shot out a tire, flipped the cruiser, and destroyed the Heart's projection.
